# An Adventure Begins (Q008): a dark elf of level 3 accepts at Jasmine, takes Roselyn's note to
# Harne, and Jasmine rewards the trip with a mark of traveler and a scroll of escape to Giran;
# then relog. Harne's page after the note names a page the datapack does not ship. Expectations
# replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q008_an_adventure_begins.golden
character Shade 3
class 31
script quest.Q008_AnAdventureBegins
